    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Sums all previous and current values. The template argument must match the type of the summed values.</para><para>This augmenter can be used for switches that increment a value, such as a debug switch where each occurrence of the switch increments a debug level:</para><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>debugLevel<sp/>=<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">switchGroup.insert(Switch(&quot;debug&quot;,<sp/>&quot;d&quot;)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.intrinsicValue(&quot;1&quot;,<sp/>integerParser(debugLevel))</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.valueAugmenter(sum&lt;int&gt;())</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.whichValue(SAVE_AUGMENTED));</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>    </detaileddescription>
